<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Lagom: Unleashing the Power of Communication and Computation Overlapping for Distributed LLM Training
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
