<td id="S3.T1.5.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">Global bandwidth of the <math id="S3.T1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>-th communication.</td></tr>
