<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F7.sf1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(a)</span> </span><span id="S4.F7.sf1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Training iteration time for different models between NCCL, AutoCCL, and Lagom through FSDP</span></figcaption>
