<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F7.sf2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(b)</span> </span><span id="S4.F7.sf2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Training iteration time for different models between NCCL, AutoCCL, and Lagom through TP/EP. </span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F7.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 7</span>. </span><span id="S4.F7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
